                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A fun sokoban-based puzzle game with an interesting mechanic investigating the successor map on N. Some excellent ideas that require thinking many steps in advance (or into the past) and looking at the problems from different viewpoints. I particularly enjoyed the rule discovery, which was intuitive but surprising. A good difficulty ramp throughout the game, with some optional side puzzles. Certainly made me think, but never to the point of frustration",
